[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:Hurry Up!]
[00:00.98]English | 英语
[00:03.04]Hurry up! | 快点！
[00:05.03]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答问题。
[00:10.67]How do you know Sam doesn't make the tea very often? | 你怎么知道山姆不经常泡茶？
[00:17.24]Can you make the tea, Sam? | 山姆，你会泡茶吗？
[00:21.51]Yes, of course I can, Penny. | 是的，我当然会，潘妮。
[00:26.41]Is there any water in this kettle? | 这个水壶里有水吗？
[00:30.51]Yes, there is. | 是的，有水。
[00:33.11]Where's the tea? | 茶在哪里？
[00:35.02]It's over there, behind the teapot. | 它在那边，茶壶后面。
[00:40.48]Can you see it? | 你能看到吗？
[00:42.61]I can see the teapot, but I can't see the tea. | 我能看到茶壶，但我看不到茶。
[00:49.31]There it is! | 它在那儿！
[00:51.26]It's in front of you! | 就在你面前！
[00:53.26]Ah yes, I can see it now. | 啊，是的，我现在看到了。
[00:58.34]Where are the cups? | 杯子在哪里？
[01:00.86]There are some in the cupboard. | 橱柜里有一些。
[01:03.93]Can you find them? | 你能找到它们吗？
[01:05.99]Yes. Here they are. | 是的。它们在这里。
[01:08.82]Hurry up, Sam! | 快点，山姆！
[01:10.96]The kettle's boiling! | 水壶开了！